OL,3,ASeven Ethiopian rebel groups form new
OL,4,Aalliance
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven Ethiopian rebel groups have
OL,7,Fannounced they have formed an alliance
OL,8,Fto remove the government in Addis Ababa
OL,9,Fand push for a transitional
OL,10,Fadministration.
OL,12,FThe alliance brings together the Fano
OL,13,Fmilitia in Amhara, the Oromo Liberation
OL,14,FArmy (OLA), Tigray People's Liberation
OL,15,FFront (TPLF) and four other smaller
OL,16,Fgroupings in a coalition named Alliance
OL,17,Ffor Survival.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
