OL,3,ASeven Ethiopian rebel groups form new
OL,4,Aalliance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe groups accuse Prime Minister Abiy
OL,7,FAhmed's government of presiding over
OL,8,F"war, genocide, mass destruction, and
OL,9,Futter poverty", claiming Ethiopia is at
OL,10,Frisk of disintegration.
OL,12,FFederal authorities have not yet
OL,13,Fresponded.
